     *   3: Base    (0-1, 20-15000 Hz)
     *   4: Type    (0-1, Low/High/Band/Notch)
     *   5: Wave    (0-1, Tri/Sin/Saw+/Saw-/Ramp/Sq/Rand)
     *   6: EnvMod  (0-1, -100..+100%)
     *   7: Drive   (0-1, 0-100% overdrive)
     *   8: Poles   (0=2P, 1=4P)
